  <OverHaulers_AccessibilityHeader>Accessibility Options</OverHaulers_AccessibilityHeader>
  
  <OverHaulers_IconScaleLabel>Breakdown Icon Scale ( {0} )</OverHaulers_IconScaleLabel>
  <OverHaulers_IconScale_Desc>Adjusts the display size of prosthetic, athletic, and injury icons rendered across InfoCard breakdowns relative to text font height.</OverHaulers_IconScale_Desc>

  <OverHaulers_ColorPaletteHeader>Medical Color Scheme &amp; Accessibility Presets</OverHaulers_ColorPaletteHeader>
  <OverHaulers_Accessibility_Desc>Customize the health status LERP colors rendered across info card breakdowns. Select a colorblind-safe accessibility preset or manually adjust RGB sliders below.</OverHaulers_Accessibility_Desc>

  <OverHaulers_PresetDefault>Standard Default</OverHaulers_PresetDefault>
  <OverHaulers_PresetDeuteranopia>Red-Green Safe ( Deut / Prot )</OverHaulers_PresetDeuteranopia>
  <OverHaulers_PresetTritanopia>Blue-Yellow Safe ( Tritanopia )</OverHaulers_PresetTritanopia>
  <OverHaulers_PresetHighContrast>High Contrast Monochromacy</OverHaulers_PresetHighContrast>
  <OverHaulers_PresetCustom>Custom Palette ( Manual Sliders )</OverHaulers_PresetCustom>

  <OverHaulers_GradientPreviewHeader>Live Health Color Gradient Preview ( 0-20% ➔ 100% ➔ 200%+ ):</OverHaulers_GradientPreviewHeader>
  <OverHaulers_ColorCriticalLabel>Critical Health Color ( 0% ➔ 20% )</OverHaulers_ColorCriticalLabel>
  <OverHaulers_ColorHealthyLabel>Healthy Baseline Color ( 100% )</OverHaulers_ColorHealthyLabel>
  <OverHaulers_ColorBoostedLabel>Boosted Capacity Color ( 100% ➔ 200%+ )</OverHaulers_ColorBoostedLabel>

  <OverHaulers_ProstheticPaletteHeader>Prosthetic &amp; Implant Breakdown Colors</OverHaulers_ProstheticPaletteHeader>
  <OverHaulers_ProstheticPalette_Desc>Optionally replace mod-defined prosthetic and implant label colors in the mass capacity breakdown. Prosthetic colors follow part efficiency; separate implants use the neutral color. Other game labels are unchanged.</OverHaulers_ProstheticPalette_Desc>
  <OverHaulers_ProstheticPalette_Enable>Use prosthetic and implant color gradient</OverHaulers_ProstheticPalette_Enable>
  <OverHaulers_ProstheticPalette_Custom>Use a separate custom palette</OverHaulers_ProstheticPalette_Custom>
  <OverHaulers_ProstheticPalette_CustomHeader>Custom Prosthetic &amp; Implant Palette</OverHaulers_ProstheticPalette_CustomHeader>
  <OverHaulers_ProstheticPalette_ResetColors>Reset colors to health palette</OverHaulers_ProstheticPalette_ResetColors>
  <OverHaulers_ProstheticGradientPreviewHeader>Prosthetic Efficiency Color Gradient Preview:</OverHaulers_ProstheticGradientPreviewHeader>
  <OverHaulers_ProstheticColorCriticalLabel>Low Efficiency Color ( 50% or less )</OverHaulers_ProstheticColorCriticalLabel>
  <OverHaulers_ProstheticColorHealthyLabel>Neutral Efficiency Color ( 100% )</OverHaulers_ProstheticColorHealthyLabel>
